<title>USA: Waltham, Mass., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Waltham, Mass., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it won $8.090 million of Waltham, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.5548 percent.</p>
</text>
